{"steam_appid":1277130,"steam_name":"Deathbound","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1277130/728174/ea2e81541e6a6672dd8e853b97a41bef22e9f31a/1751213693/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1726836202","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257039032/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726836202","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/ss_75d7a636fda268632e3a6be8865352a66fa51244.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773929875","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/ss_617b8c78cbbe660ead1bef23f559b31d59165188.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773929875","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/ss_bf1ff29578a93a5c8baf04f248826b96e085b625.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773929875","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/ss_619134d5d65b86083c45816a0b7ee61372a2286c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773929875","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/ss_7bb0723226d0d76764abcfeae0e220e4f443f4c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773929875"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/1941366f6eb2e444f7d0c113422e248e.poster.avif?t=1773929875\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/1941366f6eb2e444f7d0c113422e248e.webm?t=1773929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/1941366f6eb2e444f7d0c113422e248e.mp4?t=1773929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/0d1ed1aaed1474ec74a3de0212b9af6c.webp?t=1773929875\" width=600 height=42 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/cef5f3f33fda957b5f266ebb99852b5a.webp?t=1773929875\" width=170 height=32 /></span><br>Gain the skills, memories and identities of fallen warriors throughout the world. Combine their unique personalities and combat styles and switch between them seamlessly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/5f54263fe56506592501f240fc16323e.webp?t=1773929875\" width=287 height=32 /></span><br>The essences you absorb form your party. Deathbound features a robust party system that allows players to craft a playstyle through talent trees. Seamlessly switch between fallen warriors to harness their skills and abilities. Each party member’s affiliation in life will affect their synergy in death.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/4bf31b9332b8afbd1c3d93db53c0fdda.webp?t=1773929875\" width=239 height=32 /></span><br>Unleash the combined powers of fallen warriors with devastating Morphstrikes. Utilize different attack styles to pull-off powerful combinations and finishing blows to defeat all who oppose you. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/5e6c5296c78527a8a820fe9099e23474.webp?t=1773929875\" width=188 height=32 /></span><br>Ziêminal is a world that mixes a technological past and a medieval present, home to diverse cultures. The city of Akratya is rich in lore and dangers. Explore a city falling into ruin under the shadow of a grand crusade. From the body-filled streets to arenas and places of worship. With its imposing brutalist architecture and melding of technology, it’s a city bound for oblivion.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/173c7885ce4bc0f70936f55a64aa486a.webp?t=1773929875\" width=287 height=32 /></span><br>Face challenging enemies crafted to push you to your limits. Their very nature is based on the five stages of grief, with each new encounter commanding the attention of any soul who dare face them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/c1162eedf3d2f6fb30da31c7a29392a6.poster.avif?t=1773929875\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/c1162eedf3d2f6fb30da31c7a29392a6.webm?t=1773929875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/c1162eedf3d2f6fb30da31c7a29392a6.mp4?t=1773929875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277130/extras/ed6486684c1f932653ea4267612af45b.avif?t=1773929875\" width=600 height=64 /></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950 or Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Trialforge Studio"],"publishers":["Tate Multimedia"],"release_date":"8 Aug, 2024"}